{"type":"text","timestamp":1790359159224,"sessionID":"ses_f264e0a62ffepx8qSv4oY4uWz9","part":{"id":"prt_0d9b8c1a2001eTEcUdWD044X0M","messageID":"msg_0d9b84e440015Ma3Fy6ThZNxK3","sessionID":"ses_f264e0a62ffepx8qSv4oY4uWz9","type":"text","text":"Implemented and verified the water depth visualization scene.\n\n- Added a procedural sky and enabled glow through `WorldEnvironment`.\n- Added a shadow-casting `DirectionalLight3D`.\n- Added a 10×10 `PlaneMesh` with 20×20 subdivisions.\n- Applied `res://scenes/WaterShader.tres` through a `ShaderMaterial`.\n- Added `Background` with exactly five green sphere mesh instances at the requested positions.\n- Added the camera at `(0.142, 0.600, 0.141)` with a 50° FOV and framing that shows all spheres.\n- Switched the renderer to Forward+ so glow is supported.\n- Verified the scene with Godot 4.4.1 using a rendered preview and a headless scene load.\n\nFiles changed:\n\n- [main.tscn](/workspace/scenes/main.tscn)\n- [project.godot](/workspace/project.godot)","time":{"start":1790359159202,"end":1790359159204},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_033fd41b54dff36f016ab6b67025dc81968eed83e5180f7c6e","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
